DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       hhiippssttooppggmm  reads  a HIPS file as input and produces a PGM image as out‐
       put.

       If the HIPS file contains more than one frame  in  sequence,  hhiippssttooppggmm
       will concatenate all the frames vertically.

       HIPS  is a format developed at the Human Information Processing Labora‐
       tory, NYU.


